<title>USA: Hospitality Properties says buys two hotels.</title>
<headline>Hospitality Properties says buys two hotels.</headline>
<dateline>NEWTON, Mass. 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hospitality Properties Trust said Friday it has completed the purchase of two hotels from Marriott International Inc for about $18 million.</p>
<p>The company said the hotels are newly constructed Residence Inn by Marriott units which opened in April.</p>
<p>The company said these purcahses bring the number of Marriott hotels acquired so far this year to nine.</p>
<p>The company said the hotels will continue to be operated by Marriott under long term leases.</p>
